<title>SINGAPORE: Sri Lanka tenders to buy Miri cargo for 1H Dec.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka tenders to buy Miri cargo for 1H Dec.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state-owned Ceylon Petroleum Corp (CPC) of Sri Lanka has issued a tender to buy 450,000 barrels of Miri light crude oil for December 10-12, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender closes at 1510 hours Colombo time on November 13 and offers should be valid for 48 hours, the traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo is for delivery to Colombo on a cost and freight basis.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
